---
interface Props { kind: 'structure' | 'sequence' }
const { kind } = Astro.props;
---
<figure>
{kind === 'structure' ? <svg viewBox="0 0 700 440" role="img" aria-labelledby="fm-class-title fm-class-desc">
<title id="fm-class-title">Factory Method class relationships</title><desc id="fm-class-desc">ReportExport defines export and the abstract createFormatter hook. TextReportExport and HtmlReportExport override that hook and create matching ReportFormatter implementations. The shared export method uses the product interface.</desc>
<defs><marker id="fm-inherit" viewBox="0 0 12 12" refX="11" refY="6" markerWidth="10" markerHeight="10" orient="auto"><path d="M1 1 L11 6 L1 11 Z" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="currentColor"/></marker><marker id="fm-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/></marker></defs>
<g class="edges"><path d="M310 65 H410" marker-end="url(#fm-arrow)"/><path d="M85 180 V110" marker-end="url(#fm-inherit)"/><path d="M250 250 V110" marker-end="url(#fm-inherit)"/><path d="M500 180 V110" stroke-dasharray="5 4" marker-end="url(#fm-inherit)"/><path d="M620 250 V110" stroke-dasharray="5 4" marker-end="url(#fm-inherit)"/><path d="M225 205 H420" marker-end="url(#fm-arrow)"/><path d="M305 275 H450" marker-end="url(#fm-arrow)"/></g>
<g class="nodes"><rect x="20" y="15" width="290" height="95"/><rect x="410" y="15" width="270" height="95"/><rect x="10" y="180" width="215" height="50"/><rect x="90" y="250" width="215" height="50"/><rect x="420" y="180" width="270" height="50"/><rect x="450" y="250" width="240" height="50"/></g>
<g class="labels"><text x="165" y="40">«abstract» ReportExport</text><text x="165" y="65">export(title, tools): String</text><text x="165" y="90">createFormatter(): ReportFormatter</text><text x="545" y="47">«interface» ReportFormatter</text><text x="545" y="80">format(title, tools): String</text><text x="117" y="210">TextReportExport</text><text x="197" y="280">HtmlReportExport</text><text x="555" y="210">TextReportFormatter</text><text x="570" y="280">HtmlReportFormatter</text><text x="360" y="50" class="annotation">uses</text><text x="325" y="195" class="annotation">creates</text><text x="375" y="265" class="annotation">creates</text><text x="350" y="355" class="annotation">Hollow triangle: extends / implements</text><text x="350" y="382" class="annotation">Dashed: implements an interface</text><text x="350" y="409" class="annotation">The inherited export workflow calls the creation hook.</text></g>
</svg> : <svg viewBox="0 0 700 430" role="img" aria-labelledby="fm-seq-title fm-seq-desc">
<title id="fm-seq-title">Exporting through a factory method</title><desc id="fm-seq-desc">Client calls inherited export on HtmlReportExport. The workflow validates input, invokes the overridden createFormatter method, obtains an HtmlReportFormatter, calls format, and returns the result.</desc>
<defs><marker id="fm-seq-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/></marker></defs>
<g class="nodes"><rect x="10" y="10" width="130" height="45"/><rect x="230" y="10" width="200" height="45"/><rect x="480" y="10" width="210" height="45"/></g>
<g class="edges" stroke-dasharray="4 5"><path d="M75 55 V415"/><path d="M330 55 V415"/><path d="M585 230 V415"/></g>
<g class="edges" marker-end="url(#fm-seq-arrow)"><path d="M75 110 H330"/><path d="M330 150 H390 V195 H330"/><path d="M330 245 H585"/><path d="M330 305 H585"/><path d="M585 355 H330" stroke-dasharray="5 4"/><path d="M330 405 H75" stroke-dasharray="5 4"/></g>
<g class="labels"><text x="75" y="38">Client</text><text x="330" y="38">HtmlReportExport</text><text x="585" y="38">HtmlReportFormatter</text><text x="195" y="95">export(title, tools)</text><text x="515" y="165">validate; createFormatter()</text><text x="455" y="230">new formatter</text><text x="455" y="290">format(title, snapshot)</text><text x="455" y="342">HTML fragment</text><text x="195" y="392">HTML fragment</text></g>
</svg>}
<figcaption>{kind === 'structure' ? 'Concrete creators vary the product; the base creator retains the workflow.' : 'The export method is inherited. Dynamic dispatch selects the subclass creation hook. Dashed arrows indicate returned results.'}</figcaption>
</figure>
<style>figure{margin:28px 0;overflow-x:auto}svg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;min-width:560px;padding:10px;background:var(--surface);color:var(--muted);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px}.edges{fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.5}.nodes rect{fill:var(--soft);stroke:var(--line);rx:5}.labels{text-anchor:middle;fill:var(--ink);font:13px system-ui,sans-serif}.annotation{fill:var(--muted);font-size:12px}figcaption{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:9px}@media print{svg{min-width:0}}</style>
